---
import CallToAction from "../../components/CallToAction.astro";
import PageHero from "../../components/PageHero.astro";
import PublicLayout from "../../layouts/PublicLayout.astro";
---

<PublicLayout title="Pricing" description="Pulsyr Cloud plans: Free, Solo at USD 8 per month, and Studio at USD 20 per month. Every plan has every feature, and self-hosting is free forever.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Pricing" title="Plans differ by how much you use, never by what you get." lead="Every plan has every feature. We cap projects, collaborators, AI calls and document storage because those cost us money, not to withhold functionality. Self-hosting the open-source software is free and unlimited.">
    <div class="actions"><a class="button button-dark" data-analytics-event="cta_signup" href="https://app.pulsyr.dev/signup">Start free</a><a class="button button-outline" href="/docs/primeros-pasos/">Run it yourself</a></div>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section container" aria-labelledby="plans-heading">
    <h2 id="plans-heading" class="sr-only">Plans</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Free</span>
        <p class="plan-price">USD 0</p>
        <p class="plan-note">No card required.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>1 project</li>
          <li>1 collaborator</li>
          <li>100 AI operations a month</li>
          <li>25 MB document storage</li>
          <li>3 MCP tokens per project</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button button-outline" data-analytics-event="cta_signup" href="https://app.pulsyr.dev/signup?plan=free">Start free</a></div>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Solo · Most popular</span>
        <p class="plan-price">USD 8<span> / month</span></p>
        <p class="plan-note">Or USD 80 a year, two months free.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>5 projects</li>
          <li>3 collaborators</li>
          <li>2,000 AI operations a month</li>
          <li>5 GB document storage</li>
          <li>Unlimited MCP tokens</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button button-dark" data-analytics-event="cta_signup" href="https://app.pulsyr.dev/signup?plan=solo&amp;cycle=monthly">Choose Solo</a></div>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Studio</span>
        <p class="plan-price">USD 20<span> / month</span></p>
        <p class="plan-note">Or USD 200 a year, two months free.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Unlimited projects</li>
          <li>10 collaborators</li>
          <li>10,000 AI operations a month</li>
          <li>25 GB document storage</li>
          <li>Unlimited MCP tokens</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button button-outline" data-analytics-event="cta_signup" href="https://app.pulsyr.dev/signup?plan=studio&amp;cycle=monthly">Choose Studio</a></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-tight container prose">
    <h2>What you should know before paying</h2>
    <p><strong>Prices are in US dollars and exclude tax.</strong> Tax is added at checkout according to where you are. Payments are processed by Paddle.com Market Limited, our authorised reseller and Merchant of Record, which issues your invoice and appears on your statement.</p>
    <p><strong>Refunds within 14 days, no questions asked</strong>, on your first purchase and on every renewal. See the <a href="/reembolsos/">Refund Policy</a>.</p>
    <p><strong>Cancel from your account at any time.</strong> Access continues until the end of the period you paid for, then the account moves to Free. We never delete your data because a plan ended: what exists stays available, and only creating new projects is paused while you are above the Free limits.</p>
    <p><strong>Bring your own AI key on any plan, including Free.</strong> Usage under your own key is billed by that provider and does not count against the monthly AI operations. Configure no key at all and Pulsyr degrades gracefully: items simply carry no estimate.</p>
    <p><strong>Self-hosting is free and always will be.</strong> The software is MIT-licensed and has every feature the hosted service has. The plans above pay for our infrastructure, not for unlocking functionality.</p>
    <p>The full limits, fair-use thresholds and payment terms are in the <a href="/terminos/">hosted service terms</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <CallToAction />
</PublicLayout>

<style>
  .plan-price { margin:1rem 0 .25rem; font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.4rem); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.02em; color:var(--ink); }
  .plan-price span { font-size:.95rem; font-weight:650; color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:0; }
  .plan-note { margin:0; font-size:.85rem; color:var(--muted); }
  .sr-only { position:absolute; width:1px; height:1px; padding:0; margin:-1px; overflow:hidden; clip:rect(0,0,0,0); white-space:nowrap; border:0; }
</style>
